msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the complete FDA submission and approval history for"
" a specific drug. Returns chronological list of all submissions "
"(original, supplements, labeling changes) with dates, review priority "
"(STANDARD/PRIORITY), submission types (ORIG/SUPPL), and linked FDA review"
" documents. Useful for tracking a drug's regulatory history from initial "
"approval through all subsequent changes."
